{"id":"8de2ffea9eb2c928","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas.md","title":"Ordinal-Indexed Letterless GLB Formulas","display":"df-glb-ordinal-formulas — Ordinal-Indexed Letterless GLB Formulas","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas","aliases":["89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas"],"display":"df-glb-ordinal-formulas — Ordinal-Indexed Letterless GLB Formulas","depends_on":["[[89-df-small-ordinal-code]]","[[89-df-bimodal-formula]]","[[89-df-glb-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-glb-ordinal-formulas — Ordinal-Indexed Letterless GLB Formulas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0716e09b34db523d\" href=\"?note=0716e09b34db523d\" title=\"89-df-small-ordinal-code\">89-df-small-ordinal-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a6d483dd2c6fd176\" href=\"?note=a6d483dd2c6fd176\" title=\"89-df-bimodal-formula\">89-df-bimodal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_0,\\Box_1\">\\(\\Box_0,\\Box_1\\)</span> 是双模态自由构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top=\\neg\\bot\">\\(\\top=\\neg\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(J=(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span>，自然指数的迭代从 0 起计。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glb\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nC_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad C_{k+1}\\coloneqq\\Box_1 C_k\\ (k\\in\\omega),\\quad C_\\infty\\coloneqq\\top,\\\\\nD_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\nD_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\Box_0D_{\\alpha^-}\\lor C_{d\\alpha}\\quad(\\alpha\\ne0),\\\\\nH_\\alpha&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box_0D_\\alpha\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O),\\quad H_\\infty\\coloneqq\\top,\\\\\nD&amp;:\\mathcal O\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1},\\qquad\nH:\\mathcal O_\\infty\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1},\\qquad\nC:J\\cup\\{0\\}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glb\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nC_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad C_{k+1}\\coloneqq\\Box_1 C_k\\ (k\\in\\omega),\\quad C_\\infty\\coloneqq\\top,\\\\\nD_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\nD_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\Box_0D_{\\alpha^-}\\lor C_{d\\alpha}\\quad(\\alpha\\ne0),\\\\\nH_\\alpha&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box_0D_\\alpha\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O),\\quad H_\\infty\\coloneqq\\top,\\\\\nD&amp;:\\mathcal O\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1},\\qquad\nH:\\mathcal O_\\infty\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1},\\qquad\nC:J\\cup\\{0\\}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章 pp.213、215。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\alpha\">\\(D_\\alpha\\)</span> 的递归每次删掉码的最后一项，长度严格下降；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_k\">\\(C_k\\)</span> 的递归沿自然数下降，所以每个索引只产生有限公式，存在唯一性由有限递归给出。</p>\n<p>在 GLB 等价意义下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\alpha+1}\\leftrightarrow H_\\alpha\">\\(D_{\\alpha+1}\\leftrightarrow H_\\alpha\\)</span>，因为新增指数为 0，析取项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0=\\bot\">\\(C_0=\\bot\\)</span>；这不是原始语法树的字面相等。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\langle1\\rangle}=\\Box_0\\bot\\lor\\Box_1\\bot\">\\(D_{\\langle1\\rangle}=\\Box_0\\bot\\lor\\Box_1\\bot\\)</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_1\">\\(C_1\\)</span>，用到 GLB 的交互公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_0\\bot\\to\\Box_1\\bot\">\\(\\Box_0\\bot\\to\\Box_1\\bot\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>原书把明显等价的公式直接认同；本条保留自由语法，Remark 中的等价式是定理解释而不是额外定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-small-ordinal-code","status":"resolved","id":"0716e09b34db523d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-small-ordinal-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-bimodal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a6d483dd2c6fd176","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_0,\\Box_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\top=\\neg\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"J=(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})\\cup\\{\\infty\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glb\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nC_0&\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad C_{k+1}\\coloneqq\\Box_1 C_k\\ (k\\in\\omega),\\quad C_\\infty\\coloneqq\\top,\\\\\nD_0&\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\nD_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\Box_0D_{\\alpha^-}\\lor C_{d\\alpha}\\quad(\\alpha\\ne0),\\\\\nH_\\alpha&\\coloneqq\\Box_0D_\\alpha\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O),\\quad H_\\infty\\coloneqq\\top,\\\\\nD&:\\mathcal O\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1},\\qquad\nH:\\mathcal O_\\infty\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1},\\qquad\nC:J\\cup\\{0\\}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"D_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"C_k","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\alpha+1}\\leftrightarrow H_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"C_0=\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\langle1\\rangle}=\\Box_0\\bot\\lor\\Box_1\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"C_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_0\\bot\\to\\Box_1\\bot","display":false}],"bytes":1924,"backlinks":[{"id":"e82c18eddcbe3ca2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ab1164e8495d4ee1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"15ef78b25d5206a3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"序数与公式：[[89-df-small-ordinal-code]] → [[89-lem-small-ordinal-operations]] → [[89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas]] → [[89-lem-glb-box-absorption]] → [[89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison]] → [[89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation]]。"}],"outgoing":["0716e09b34db523d","a6d483dd2c6fd176","5a9efa2261b8f73c"]}